    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Scraps of knowledge have taught you how to exploit the vulnerabilities of creatures and the powers of mystical objects.\n\n**Multiclass Thaumaturge Characters:**\nThaumaturge suits characters who want to glean strange knowledge. It's especially useful for those who tend to fight with one-handed weapons, like swashbucklers or rogues, since they have their other hand free for an implement."
